sequenceDiagram
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant R as Redis
    participant L as LLM

    API->>API: Build canonical payload
    API->>API: Hash SHA-256
    API->>R: GET cache key
    alt cache hit
        R-->>API: cached response
    else cache miss
        API->>L: generate response
        L-->>API: response
        API->>R: SET response EX ttl
    end
